  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that multimodal models with multiprofile settings, scvi_n200 RNA encoder, and imagenet_vit_l image encoder achieve high accuracy (e.g., config_039: 0.725). This experiment tests whether replacing the RNA encoder with scgpt (a different architecture) while keeping the same image encoder, aggregation (transformer), and fusion (weighted) could further improve performance. It clarifies the impact of RNA encoder choice on accuracy, leveraging the strong foundation of the current top-performing configuration."
